                    <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="100" height="100" src="https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Noise-Disturbances-04-qyxw92x8sap2p5ei6dosof3miiakqvbbf8mtjblre0.png" class="attachment- size-" alt="" />                </div>
          </div>
                <div class="box-body">
                            <h3 class="elementskit-info-box-title">
                    Noise Disturbances                </h3>
                        		  	<p>At night, pigeons and other birds can cause disturbances with their cooing, scratching, and flapping around your roof or air conditioning units. These noises can affect your sleep and cause unnecessary stress.</p>
