					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-a9f9b92" data-id="a9f9b92" data-element_type="column" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a95347b elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-heading" data-id="a95347b" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="elementskit-heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="ekit-wid-con" ><div class="ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_left   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-"><h2 class="ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-title ">Signs of Bird Infestation</h2></div></div>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-cc342b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="cc342b7" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>How can you tell if birds are making a home on your property? Keep an eye out for these common signs of bird infestation:</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9d3fdbf e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="9d3fdbf" data-element_type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c9a4af3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="c9a4af3" data-element_type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6e22567 elementor-align-left elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list" data-id="6e22567" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="icon-list.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<ul class="elementor-icon-list-items">
							<li class="elementor-icon-list-item">
											<span class="elementor-icon-list-icon">
