		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d3bcb94 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="d3bcb94" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1718067 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="1718067" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-78b0737 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="78b0737" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">The Advantages of Bird Proofing for Solar Panels in Melbourne</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-751b963 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="751b963" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Investing in bird proofing for your solar panels not only protects your system but also ensures optimal performance and longevity. While the costs of bird-proofing can vary depending on your specific needs, the benefits far outweigh the expense. Here’s why bird proofing is a must for solar panel owners in Melbourne:</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-62fdcad e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="62fdcad" data-element_type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-47a78bd e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="47a78bd" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3f71c8a elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="3f71c8a" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="800" src="https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Reduced-Maintenance-Costs-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-7925" alt="" srcset="https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Reduced-Maintenance-Costs-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Reduced-Maintenance-Costs-2048x2048-1-300x300.png 300w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Reduced-Maintenance-Costs-2048x2048-1-150x150.png 150w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Reduced-Maintenance-Costs-2048x2048-1-768x768.png 768w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Reduced-Maintenance-Costs-2048x2048-1-1536x1536.png 1536w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Reduced-Maintenance-Costs-2048x2048-1.png 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />															</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-239054b elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box" data-id="239054b" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="icon-box.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-icon-box-wrapper">

			
						<div class="elementor-icon-box-content">

									<h3 class="elementor-icon-box-title">
						<span  >
							Cut Down on Repair and Maintenance Costs						</span>
					</h3>
				
									<p class="elementor-icon-box-description">
						Bird droppings and nests can damage electrical components, wires, and other parts of your solar system. These issues often lead to costly repairs. Bird-proofing your panels helps you avoid frequent maintenance and repairs, saving you money in the long run by reducing the chances of damage caused by birds.					</p>
				
			</div>
			
		</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-161dace e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="161dace" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-df19d9e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="df19d9e" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="800" src="https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Maximised-Energy-Efficiency-02-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-7921" alt="" srcset="https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Maximised-Energy-Efficiency-02-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Maximised-Energy-Efficiency-02-2048x2048-1-300x300.png 300w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Maximised-Energy-Efficiency-02-2048x2048-1-150x150.png 150w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Maximised-Energy-Efficiency-02-2048x2048-1-768x768.png 768w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Maximised-Energy-Efficiency-02-2048x2048-1-1536x1536.png 1536w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Maximised-Energy-Efficiency-02-2048x2048-1.png 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />															</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-17d5b9b elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box" data-id="17d5b9b" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="icon-box.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-icon-box-wrapper">

			
						<div class="elementor-icon-box-content">

									<h3 class="elementor-icon-box-title">
						<span  >
							Boost Energy Efficiency						</span>
					</h3>
				
									<p class="elementor-icon-box-description">
						When birds nest under your solar panels, they obstruct sunlight, which reduces the amount of energy your system can produce. By investing in bird proofing, you ensure your panels remain clean and unobstructed, allowing them to generate more power, ultimately boosting the overall energy efficiency of your solar system.					</p>
				
			</div>
			
		</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8936d07 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="8936d07" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4181880 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="4181880" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="800" src="https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Extended-Solar-Panel-Lifespan-01-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-7918" alt="" srcset="https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Extended-Solar-Panel-Lifespan-01-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Extended-Solar-Panel-Lifespan-01-2048x2048-1-300x300.png 300w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Extended-Solar-Panel-Lifespan-01-2048x2048-1-150x150.png 150w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Extended-Solar-Panel-Lifespan-01-2048x2048-1-768x768.png 768w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Extended-Solar-Panel-Lifespan-01-2048x2048-1-1536x1536.png 1536w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Extended-Solar-Panel-Lifespan-01-2048x2048-1.png 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />															</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5d86832 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box" data-id="5d86832" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="icon-box.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-icon-box-wrapper">

			
						<div class="elementor-icon-box-content">

									<h3 class="elementor-icon-box-title">
						<span  >
							Enhance the Longevity of Your Solar Panels						</span>
					</h3>
				
									<p class="elementor-icon-box-description">
						Birds, especially pigeons and seagulls, can cause significant damage by nesting under your solar panels. Droppings, nests, and debris can lead to corrosion, block sunlight, and eventually reduce the lifespan of your panels. Bird-proofing your panels prevents these issues, helping them last longer and continue to work efficiently.					</p>
				
			</div>
			
		</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e86bf87 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="e86bf87" data-element_type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e635623 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="e635623" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9713de7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="9713de7" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="800" src="https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Continuous-Solar-Output-07-07-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-7937" alt="Continuous-Solar-Output" srcset="https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Continuous-Solar-Output-07-07-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Continuous-Solar-Output-07-07-2048x2048-1-300x300.png 300w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Continuous-Solar-Output-07-07-2048x2048-1-150x150.png 150w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Continuous-Solar-Output-07-07-2048x2048-1-768x768.png 768w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Continuous-Solar-Output-07-07-2048x2048-1-1536x1536.png 1536w, https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Continuous-Solar-Output-07-07-2048x2048-1.png 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />															</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3774c48 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box" data-id="3774c48" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="icon-box.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-icon-box-wrapper">

			
						<div class="elementor-icon-box-content">

									<h3 class="elementor-icon-box-title">
						<span  >
							Consistent Solar Energy Generation						</span>
					</h3>
				
									<p class="elementor-icon-box-description">
						Birds can disrupt the operation of your solar panels, leading to inconsistent energy output. By installing effective bird-proofing measures, you ensure that your solar system continues to operate smoothly and consistently, reducing downtime and ensuring you get the most from your solar investment.					</p>
				
			</div>
			
		</div>
