							<svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double" viewBox="0 0 512 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z"></path></svg>						</span>
										<span class="elementor-icon-list-text">Looking for Expert Solar Panel Bird Proofing?</span>
									</li>
						</ul>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-071f58a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="071f58a" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>If you’re in Melbourne and need reliable solar panel bird mesh installation, look no further! 7 States Pest Control is here to help protect your investment with top-quality bird proofing solutions. Reach out now for a free, no-obligation quote and let us keep your solar panels safe.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4c08d72 elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list" data-id="4c08d72" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="icon-list.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<ul class="elementor-icon-list-items">
							<li class="elementor-icon-list-item">
											<span class="elementor-icon-list-icon">
							<svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double" viewBox="0 0 512 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z"></path></svg>						</span>
										<span class="elementor-icon-list-text">Don’t Wait Until It’s Too Late</span>
									</li>
						</ul>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-879c38b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="879c38b" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p class="" data-start="220" data-end="668">If you haven’t noticed bird activity around your solar panels yet, don’t wait for the damage to start. <a rel="noopener" data-start="325" data-end="362">Contact us today</a> for a quick, same-day inspection and ensure your panels are protected from potential nesting and damage. We specialize in <strong data-start="487" data-end="530">Bird Blocking</strong> to prevent costly damage to your solar system, and our team is ready to help you maintain the safety and efficiency of your solar panels.</p><p class="" data-start="670" data-end="918"><strong data-start="670" data-end="699">Birds around solar panels</strong> can create significant issues, from nesting to debris buildup, which can lead to costly repairs. With our <strong data-start="806" data-end="823">Bird Blocking</strong> services, we’ll help protect your solar investment and keep your panels functioning optimally.</p><p class="" data-start="1127" data-end="1350">We also offer a range of other pest control services such as <strong data-start="1188" data-end="1238"><a href="https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/our-services/rodent-control-melbourne/" rel="noopener" data-start="1190" data-end="1236">Rodent Extermination</a></strong> and <a rel="noopener" data-start="1245" data-end="1286">Bed Bug Removal</a> to ensure your home remains safe from pests all year round.</p><p class="" data-start="1352" data-end="1520">For more pest prevention tips and expert advice, check out our <a rel="noopener" data-start="1417" data-end="1450">latest </a><strong data-start="1415" data-end="1452"><a href="https://7statespestcontrol.com.au/blog/" rel="noopener" data-start="1417" data-end="1450">blog </a></strong><a rel="noopener" data-start="1417" data-end="1450">post</a> to learn how to protect your home from unwanted pests and damage.</p><p class="" data-start="1522" data-end="1659">Don’t wait until it’s too late! Get in touch with <strong>7 State<a rel="noopener" data-start="1574" data-end="1616"> Pest Control</a></strong> today and ensure your home is protected.</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
